    "created_at": "2024-11-15T10:54:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-15T10:54:17Z",
    "body": "In particular it's not clear how you tie some script that is executing back to its `script` element. That's not a concept that exists. E.g., what if this script creates some elements with event handlers that invoke the relevant permissions?",
