    "updated_at": "2024-11-18T09:30:40Z",
    "body": "Hi @annevk \r\n\r\nThanks for questioning this concept. In fact, this made me realise I misinterpreted how the permission policy actually works.\r\n\r\nIt seems I'm not the only one who's made this kind of thinking mistake—ChatGPT appears to have done the same. Here's an example: https://chatgpt.com/share/673b0256-2fe4-800b-977e-c513ba0209fe\r\n\r\nYou can close this issue. I'll leave it up to you if you think ChatGPT giving wrong information is worth opening another issue.",
